Summary (English, for information only; the German text prevails):
The source code of the NCWiki website (templates, stylesheets, scripts,
workflows, configuration) may be viewed on GitHub but may not be copied,
modified, redistributed or reused without prior written permission. This does
not cover the practice exercises (CC BY-NC 4.0), the website content (all
rights reserved) or third-party software and fonts, which keep their own
licenses. Contact: info@nc-wiki.ch
